OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's hub benefits not clear,
OL,4,Asays scrutiny
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a central Children's Services
OL,7,FHub do not represent the "best use of
OL,8,Fpublic money", according to a scrutiny
OL,9,Fcommittee.
OL,11,FThe Health and Social Care Department
OL,12,F(HSC) wants to bring the services teams
OL,13,Ffrom five separate locations to a
OL,14,Frefurbished Raymond Falla House in St
OL,15,FMartins at a cost of up to #22m.
OL,17,FHSC President George Oswald said the
OL,18,Fcurrent sites have not been not fit for
OL,19,Fpurpose for "some time".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
