OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's hub benefits not clear,
OL,4,Asays scrutiny
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a letter, scrutiny lead Andy Sloan
OL,7,Fsaid he accepted better accommodation
OL,8,Fwas a "legitimate objective" but even a
OL,9,F"desirable project still requires a
OL,10,Fdemonstrable business case" and there
OL,11,Fwere questions about whether
OL,12,F"realistic, less costly alternatives"
OL,13,Fhad been considered.
